      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please fix this WARNING reported by Error Prone: [UnusedVariable] The field \u0027MICRODROID_CONSOLE_PATH\u0027 is never read.\n\nAnalyzer Description: Warnings generated by errorprone.\nOwner: farivar@google.com\n\n    [UnusedVariable] The field \u0027MICRODROID_CONSOLE_PATH\u0027 is never read.\n        @NonNull private static final String MICRODROID_CONSOLE_PATH \u003d TEST_ROOT + \"console.txt\";\n                                             ^\n        (see https://errorprone.info/bugpattern/UnusedVariable)\n      Did you mean to remove this line?\n\nUse `m RUN_ERROR_PRONE\u003dtrue MyModule` to reproduce locally.\n\nThis finding was found on https://android-build.googleplex.com/builds/build-details/P50626364/targets/errorprone, but may also be present on other builds.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 59,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 59,
        "endChar": 93
      },
      "revId": "c03f66171425c0aec268615f59f4705bac0e50f4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "735916aa_dea2f76c",
        "filename": "tests/hostside/java/com/android/microdroid/test/PvmfwDebugPolicyHostTests.java",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 172,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-23T09:43:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In terms of coverage, would it make sense to also test combinations with the above test? I mean\n```\nfor ramdump, log in product([true, false], 2):\n    pvmfw \u003d create_pvmfw(dtbo)\n    result \u003d launch()\n    assert(result.has_console_output() \u003d\u003d log)\n    assert(result.hash_crash_kernel() \u003d\u003d ramdump)\n```\n? The pain point would be the DTBO but I\u0027m wondering if we could rework these tests to generate the `dts` programmatically from Java (and store them as artifacts, for debugging the test?) and call `dtc` inline with the test? I know we\u0027ve already discussed this but I can\u0027t remember why we went with calling `dtc` from Soong instead?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 172,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 172,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "c03f66171425c0aec268615f59f4705bac0e50f4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6d265c7c_68dd9fba",
        "filename": "tests/hostside/java/com/android/microdroid/test/PvmfwDebugPolicyHostTests.java",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 219,
